Canvas Customizer Privacy Policy

Canvas Customizer is a browser extension that enhances and customizes the Canvas LMS interface.

Data accessed

Canvas Customizer may access information displayed by or available through Canvas LMS, including course names, course identifiers, assignments, due dates, calendar events, course colors, links, and other Canvas content required to provide the extension's features.

Canvas Customizer also stores information intentionally created or configured by the user, such as themes, dashboard layouts, hidden elements, Notes, Quick Links, local Week Schedule events, To-Do preferences, and other customization settings.

How data is used

This information is used only to provide Canvas Customizer's user-facing functionality, including interface customization, themes, dashboard organization, To-Do features, scheduling widgets, and related productivity tools.

Local storage

Canvas Customizer stores its settings and locally created information using Chrome extension storage in the user's browser.

Canvas Customizer does not operate a developer-controlled server for collecting Canvas account data, course information, browsing activity, Notes, or customization data.

Data sharing

Canvas Customizer does not sell user data.

Canvas Customizer does not transfer user data to third parties for advertising, marketing, profiling, creditworthiness, or unrelated purposes.

Analytics and advertising

Canvas Customizer does not include advertising, behavioral tracking, or third-party analytics.

Authentication

Canvas Customizer does not collect or store Canvas passwords or authentication credentials. Requests to Canvas are made through the user's existing authenticated Canvas browser session.

Backups and exported themes

Backup and theme export files are created only when requested by the user and are downloaded directly to the user's device. Canvas Customizer does not upload these files to the developer.

Changes

Canvas Customizer is currently beta software and may change as development continues. This privacy policy will be updated if the extension's data handling practices materially change.

Limited Use

Data accessed by Canvas Customizer is used only to provide or improve the extension's disclosed user-facing functionality.

Canvas Customizer does not sell user data, use user data for advertising, or transfer user data for purposes unrelated to the extension's functionality.
